reward=1 magic lamp worth 60,000 XP and 3 magic lamps worth 50,000 XP each in a skill of your choice.<br>You gain the following extra benefits:<br>- 10% discount from the Smuggler.<br>- Access to Daemonheim hard mode.<br>- Access to an extended portion of the resource dungeon in the Brimhaven dungeon.<br>- Second gatestone and teleport spell.<br>- Regain prayer points when bones are buried.
name=Daemonheim Set Tasks - Elite
desc=0,Given by Thok in the camp for completing all Elite Tasks in Daemonheim.
