runescore=15
reward=Underworld Grimoire 3 and 1 magic lamp, worth 25,000 XP in a skill of your choice (level 70+).<br>You gain the following extra permanent, passive benefits:<br>- 20 weekly dragon bones, 12 greater ghostly ink and greater ritual candles from Lupe.<br>- Lupe will now sell 10 buckets of slime daily.<br>- The mushroom patch in Um will no longer become diseased.<br>The grimoire gains the following extra benefits:<br>- Unlimited free teleports to the Um/Ungael ritual site.<br>The grimoire gains the following extra benefits while worn:<br>- Dropped dragon bones, dagannoth bones, airut bones, ourg bones, hardened dragon bones and dragonkin bones are sent to the focus storage (toggleable).<br>- 10% chance to make 4-dose extreme necromancy potions while in Um.<br>- 7.5% chance per impure essence of receiving extra runes from runecrafting.<br>- +9% XP from dispelling ritual disturbances.<br>- +10% necroplasm from rituals.
name=Underworld Set Tasks - Hard
desc=0,Given by Kili, by the smithy in Um, for completing all Hard Tasks in the Underworld.
